      en: ["The flagpole was officially inaugurated on June 26, 2008.", "At 133 meters tall, it was the world's highest flagpole from 2008 until 2010.", "The national flag itself covers a total area of 1,837.5 square meters.", "The flag fabric weighs approximately 420 kilograms (926 pounds).", "The structure was designed and built by a specialized engineering firm from Dubai.", "Military guard mounting ceremonies are often held at the base of the monument."],
