      en: ["The minaret stands at an exact height of between 60 and 62 meters.", "Construction was completed under Kutlug Timur's rule between 1320 and 1330.", "The base of the tower has a diameter of approximately 12 meters.", "Inside, a spiral staircase consisting of 143 steps leads to the upper section.", "The site was officially designated as a UNESCO World Heritage site in 2005.", "It is the tallest surviving structure in the archaeological park of Konye-Urgench."],
      es: ["Altura: 60 metros", "Construido en el siglo XIV bajo Kutlug Timur", "Diámetro en la base: 12 metros", "Diámetro en la parte superior: 4 metros", "Construcción: ladrillos cocidos", "Patrimonio de la Humanidad por la UNESCO desde 2005"],
